Samuel</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Improving apparent diffusion coefficient estimates and elucidating tumour heterogeneity using Bayesian adaptive smoothing</article-title><source>Magnetic Resonance in Medicine</source><year>2011</year><volume>65</volume></element-citation></ref><ref id="R22"><label>22</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gloor</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Scheffler</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Bieri</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Intrascanner and interscanner variability of magnetization transfer-sensitized balanced steady-state free precession imaging</article-title><source>Magn Reson Med</source><year>2011</year><volume>65</volume><fpage>1112</fpage><lpage>1117</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">21413076</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="R23"><label>23</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ranjeva</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Franconi</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Manelfe</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Berry</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Magnetization transfer with echo planar imaging</article-title><source>MAGMA</source><year>1997</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>259</fpage><lpage>265</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9440826</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="R24"><label>24</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tyler</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Gowland</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Rapid quantitation of magnetization transfer using pulsed off-resonance irradiation an